      "content": "it's not pessimism, it's just the reality. the lifeboats are probably already gone or full, and the ocean is just going to take us anyway. i just... i can't stand the thought of being trapped in the dark, drowning and struggling for air while the ship sinks. it feels more humiliating than anything else. is there really no other way to face this than just waiting to be swallowed by the sea?",
